# Converted character models. `tools/fbx-to-glb.py` produces these from an
# FBX, and dropping one in is all it takes for the game to use it — which is
# also why one is not committed by accident. When the project settles on the
# art it ships, add it deliberately with `git add -f`.
public/assets/characters/*.glb
